  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till Rigas flygplats</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Riga Airport</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Continuing Quality Management and Maintenance System Program, ie. through transfer of knowledge ensure safety, regularity, effectivity and efficiency within the system. The project is jointly financed by Sida and the Riga International Airport. Sidas contribution amounts to SEK 1 502 000. Swedish counterpart is Swedavia.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Quality management and Maintenance System Program vid Rigas  flygplats. Insatsen best&#xe5;r i r&#xe5;dgivning och tillg&#xe5;ng till expertis inom omr&#xe5;det f&#xf6;r att skapa b&#xe4;ttre system f&#xf6;r s&#xe4;kerhet, underh&#xe5;ll och effektivitet inom systemet. Sidas st&#xf6;d uppg&#xe5;r till SEK 1 502 000, och den svenska samarbetsparten &#xe4;r Swedavia.</narrative>
  </description>
